            <span class="section-label">Who We Are</span>
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>Frostline Wellness is Idaho and Utah's trusted source for premium cold plunge systems. As an authorized Plunge Zero dealer, we help homeowners, athletes, gyms, and wellness facilities bring professional-grade cold therapy into their daily routines.</p>
            <p>Based in Mountain Home, Idaho, our focus is simple: provide exceptional products, honest guidance, and local support you can count on.</p>
            <div class="about-brief-actions">
