    <!-- VALUE PROPOSITION / WHY COLD THERAPY -->
    <section class="section dark-section value-prop">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="value-prop-grid">
          <div class="value-prop-text">
            <span class="section-label light">The Science</span>
            <h2>Why Cold Therapy</h2>
            <p>Cold water immersion causes a huge wave of physiological responses. When your body is exposed to cold, blood vessels constrict, reducing inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints. Even after you step out of the tub and body temperature increases, the benefits continue. Your circulation surges, flushing metabolic waste, delivering oxygen-rich blood to tissues, and accelerating repair. Consistent exposure also triggers the release of norepinephrine, a hormone that can improve mood, focus, and pain tolerance.</p>
            <p>The benefits compound over time. Athletes and active individuals use cold therapy to cut recovery time and reduce soreness after intense training. Beyond performance, consistent cold plunges have been associated with improved sleep quality, reduced anxiety, stronger immune response, and a measurable boost in daily energy.</p>
            <a href="about.html" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-large">Our Story</a>
          </div>
          <div class="value-prop-img">
            <div class="img-placeholder tall" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;"><img src="project%20media/residential-saunaskin-softtop-led-use.png" alt="SaunaSkin cold plunge with LED lighting" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AUTHORIZED PARTNER -->
    <section class="section brands">
      <div class="container" style="max-width:800px; text-align:center;">
        <span class="section-label">Our Partner</span>
        <h2>Authorized Plunge Zero Dealer</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:1.25rem; line-height:1.7;">Frostline Wellness is an officially authorized dealer for Plunge Zero, one of the most established names in professional cold plunge technology. Every system we sell is a genuine Plunge Zero unit backed by the manufacturer's warranty and built to the same performance standards used by professional athletes and elite wellness facilities.</p>
        <p style="font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--text-muted); margin-top:1rem; line-height:1.7;">Choosing an authorized dealer like Frostline Wellness means you get the real product with full support: genuine components, warranty coverage, and a local team that stands behind every sale.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

