          <div class="why-card reveal-item">
            <div class="why-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Local Idaho &amp; Utah Service</h3>
            <p>Based in Mountain Home, Idaho, we serve our region personally. You'll work with real people who know your area.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="why-card reveal-item">
            <div class="why-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 5v3h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Free Shipping Included</h3>
            <p>Every Plunge Zero system ships free to your door throughout Idaho and Utah. No hidden freight charges or surprise fees at checkout.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="why-card reveal-item">
            <div class="why-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Expert Guidance</h3>
            <p>Not sure which system is right for you? We'll walk you through the options, answer your questions, and make sure you get exactly what fits your space and goals.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="section dark-section faq">
      <div class="container faq-container">
        <span class="section-label light">Common Questions</span>
        <h2>FAQ</h2>
        <div class="faq-list">

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">How cold do Plunge Zero units actually get?</button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Plunge Zero systems can cool water down to approximately 39&deg;F (4&deg;C), well within the optimal range for cold water immersion therapy. The built-in chiller maintains a consistent temperature so you get the same experience every session.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">Do you offer free shipping?</button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes &mdash; we include free shipping on all orders to addresses within Idaho and Utah. All standard deliveries are curbside drop-off. If you need additional delivery assistance, contact us before ordering and we'll do our best to accommodate.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">How difficult is setup?</button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Super easy! Just plug the unit into a standard outlet - no special electrical work or plumbing required. Fill it with water, set your temperature, and you're ready to plunge.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">What warranty comes with a Plunge Zero unit?</button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>Residential units come with a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Commercial units include warranty coverage as well. Please review our <a href="warranty.html" style="color:var(--accent);">Warranty page</a> for full details. Buying through an authorized dealer like Frostline Wellness ensures your warranty is fully valid.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

